      "message": "This needs a lot more explanation and also isn\u0027t quite accurate.\n\nThe clusters are monotonic. What seems to be the issue here is when glyphs placements are not monotonically increasing. So a more appropriate title would be \"Fix MinIntrinsicWidth calculation for non-monotonic glyph placement\" or something like that.\n\nAlso an explanation for how this is being fixed in this change should be added, because it isn\u0027t easy to follow the side effects of this change.",
